2.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whendidhermesbecomeevri" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whendidhermesbecomeevri" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whendidhermesbecomeevri-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In 2022, we rebranded from Hermes to Evri. As well as rebranding from Hermes to Evri, we also refreshed our core values. You can see our core values above.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whatwasevricalledbeforehermes-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatwasevricalledbeforehermes" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatwasevricalledbeforehermes" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-What was Evri called before Hermes?-open answer" data-test-id="whatwasevricalledbeforehermes-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatwasevricalledbeforehermes-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What was Evri called before Hermes?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatwasevricalledbeforehermes" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatwasevricalledbeforehermes" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatwasevricalledbeforehermes-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri has had a few different names before Hermes. If you look at the timeline above, you can see exactly when we changed names and some key milestones in our company&#39;s history. Our previous names were: Grattan Mail Order, Next Directory, Parcelnet, Hermes Parcelnet Ltd, and then we became Evri.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whydidevripurchasedhlecommerce-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whydidevripurchasedhlecommerce" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whydidevripurchasedhlecommerce" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Why did Evri purchase DHL eCommerce?-open answer" data-test-id="whydidevripurchasedhlecommerce-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whydidevripurchasedhlecommerce-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Why did Evri purchase DHL eCommerce?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whydidevripurchasedhlecommerce" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whydidevripurchasedhlecommerce" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whydidevripurchasedhlecommerce-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In 2025, Evri announced a partnership with DHL eCommerce. This marked the beginning of a new phase in the company&#39;s growth, often referred to as our &#39;next chapter.&#39; The partnership is designed to strengthen our international capabilities, expand our delivery network, and improve services for customers and businesses across the UK and globally. While Evri continues to operate under its own brand, the collaboration with DHL Ecommerce supports long-term investment in technology, infastructure, and service quality.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></main></div></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{ENV_NAME:"prod",PUBLIC_PATH:"https://www.evri.com",WEB_BASE:"https://www.evri.com/",PRISMIC_REPO:"ev-mercury",DEVTOOLS:false,API_BASE:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/",AUTH0_USERS_ENDPOINT:"https://he